                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 157,
                            "last_played": 1709528008
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very simple arcade style shoot em up. While I give this game a thumbs up, there isn't a whole lot too it. You play a level get money for each enemy you killed, then can buy stat boosts between levels, and repeat until you die. Once dead, your name gets entered on the local leader board, and then you can start all over again.\n\nYou can choose from a few different weapon loadouts for your ship and you also get three bombs in each level, but that's about it for variance. There are no pickups in the levels, and the weapons never visually change, they just simply do more damage.\n\nThe achievements are overall relatively simple. The hardest of which is having 10k gold between levels. I played to about level 18 to get this achievement myself, cursing the scorpion boss every time I faced him =P",
